		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Legendary Cloth Armor</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 2,650,777 g</p><p><em>Lined with ley-infused thread to empower magical ability. Worn by only the most powerful of mages.</em></p><hr><p><strong>5+INT Armor.</strong></p><p>Grants +1 to your spell save DCs.</p><p><strong>Confluence.</strong> (1/Safe Rest) Gain 3 actions. Until the end of your turn, your spells are not subject to the rushed attacks penalty.</p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; SanityWithIn, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
